<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CPC raised by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CPC raised by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded CPC International Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral and maintained its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 79-3/8 Friday.</p>
